### ============================================================================
### Upload — HRIS Client API
### ============================================================================
# Requires the VS Code "REST Client" extension (or a compatible .http runner).
# Click "Send Request" on "Login" first so the session cookie is reused.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:9000/api
@email = admin@company.com
@password = Password123!

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/_login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Generate upload URL
POST {{baseUrl}}/upload/generate-url
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mime_type": "image/jpeg",
  "is_public": true
}
